WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Two pictures. One choice. Then the researcher hands you the picture you did not select.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
In a 2005 experiment, some people never noticed the switch.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
They even explained why they had picked the substitute.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Scientists call this choice blindness. It is a specific experimental effect—not mind control.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
An audio routine can offer structure. The experiment does not show that a product changes your brain.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Try a free twelve-minute start. Then examine the evidence before considering an offer.
